# macsec_phy_po_type_nve_1715.py
# Modular MACsec / PHY / Port-channel / Type / NVE bodies (IOS XE 17.15)
# Placeholders use $…; NS dict supplies $N, $NC.
#
# DESIGN RULES (modular / operational):
#   * No hardcoded sibling leaves — optional keywords (probe, mcast-group
#     min/max, standalone-disable, etc.) are caller-driven via $*_block
#     fragments or individual templates.
#   * Repeatable structures (member vni entries) are loop-friendly:
#     the engine iterates one VNI at a time.
#   * Interface scaffolding is owned by the caller's wrapper — bodies
#     here are bare interface-scoped nodes.

